          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does French vanilla mean on a protein tub?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Nothing regulated. French vanilla traditionally describes a rich, custard-style vanilla, so on a protein tub it usually signals a sweeter, creamier flavor than a plain or vanilla bean version. The name tells you the intended taste, not the ingredients, so check the label for the sweetener, gums and protein source before you buy."
          }
        }
      ],
    },
